#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Browse Settings</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:1749
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use Web Services Dynamic Discovery (WS-Discovery) for browsing"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1752
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Web Services Dynamic Discovery (WS-Discovery) protocol is used to browse "
"the local network and discover workgroups, domains and hosts. This is useful "
"if your network neighborhood is dominated by servers with modern &Windows; "
"versions. If you use this option, there should be no need to force &Samba;'s "
"client library to use the SMB protocol version 1.0 to search for workgroups "
"and domains."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting is optional, and only appears if you compiled &smb4k; with WS-"
"Discovery support."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:1759
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use DNS Service Discovery (DNS-SD) for browsing"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1762
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The DNS Service Discovery (DNS-SD) interface is used to browse the local "
"network and discover servers that provide shared SMB resources. The "
"discovered domains correspond to the local DNS domains (&eg;, named LOCAL) "
"and most likely not the ones defined in the network neighborhood. However, "
"this does not influence the browsing. If you use this option, there is no "
"need to force &Samba;'s client library to use the SMB protocol version 1.0 "
"when searching for workgroups and domains."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:1768
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force SMB protocol version 1.0 for workgroup and domain lookups"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1771
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option as a last resort, because the SMB protocol version 1.0 is "
"unsafe and has been disabled in newer &Samba; and &Windows; versions. "
"However, if you have trouble discovering workgroups and domains in your "
"network neighborhood, you might want to consider switching this setting on. "
"If you are using DNS Service Discovery (DNS-SD) or Web Services Dynamic "
"Discovery (WS-Discovery), and those are working for you, you do not need "
"version 1.0."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1772 index.docbook:1783 index.docbook:1889 index.docbook:1958
#: index.docbook:1967 index.docbook:1976 index.docbook:1985 index.docbook:2002
#: index.docbook:2066 index.docbook:2082 index.docbook:2111 index.docbook:2120
